  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NEPCO: Liquidity facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of a sovereign guaranteed loan to the National Electric Power Company  (NEPCO) to assist NEPCO in preserving the stability of the electrical system  and manage its liquidity constraints resulting from the ongoing COVID-19 crisis.  The proceeds of the Bank&apos;s loan will be used to provide urgent liquidity  support to NEPCO to meet its short-term payment obligations. The project is  developed under the Vital Infrastructure Support Programme (VISP) which is part  of the EBRD COVID-19 Solidarity Package.</narrative>
  </description>
